<title>USA: NY cert cotton stocks fall 1,298 bales to 103,094.</title>
<headline>NY cert cotton stocks fall 1,298 bales to 103,094.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Certificated cotton stocks deliverable against New York Cotton Exchange's No. 2 cotton futures contract as of July 30 totaled 103,094 bales, down from 104,392 bales the previous session.</p>
<p>There were no bales issued, no bales awaiting review, 1,298 cancellations, and 401 decertification orders. ((New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1640))</p>
